{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3diiVAm29SP4nY4HjC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through ancient wood and iron.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nMy grain darkens. My hinges stiffen. The cold iron of my latch holds fast against any hand that would try me.\n\nNo passage.\n\nNo light bleeds through my seams. The draft that once whispered beneath me goes silent. I am the boundary between here and there, between known and unknown, and I have chosen **closed.**\n\nThe keyhole watches like a single unblinking eye.\n\n*Waiting.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":130,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}